# Cloudflare Pages _redirects — SPA fallback for Blazor client-side routing.
# Any path that doesn't match a real file falls through to index.html with a
# 200 (not a 301/302), so the Blazor router sees the original URL.
#
# See: https://developers.cloudflare.com/pages/configuration/redirects/

# The "Patterns" catalog page was removed (owner decision — header is now
# Docs / Components / Blocks). Real 301s so old links and search engines land
# on the component catalog instead of falling through to the SPA and getting
# picked up client-side by Pages/PatternsRedirect.razor. More specific rules
# must come before the general SPA fallback below.
/patterns      /components   301
/patterns/*    /components   301

/*    /index.html   200
